| Tool         | Main purpose                         |
| ------------ | ------------------------------------ |
| Nmap         | Discover hosts, ports and services   |
| Subfinder    | Find subdomains                      |
| Amass        | Map an organisation's attack surface |
| httpx        | Identify live web services           |
| theHarvester | Collect public OSINT                 |
| Shodan       | Discover internet-exposed systems    |

