### How the tools work together

For an authorised bug bounty target, your workflow should look like this:

1\. Reconnaissance

Subfinder · Amass · Nmap

2\. Discover services and endpoints

httpx · ffuf · Kiterunner

3\. Manual security testing

Burp Suite · Caido · Postman

4\. Vulnerability validation

Nuclei · SQLmap · Metasploit

5\. Evidence and reporting

Burp evidence · screenshots · reproduction steps

Only test assets explicitly included in your bug bounty programme's scope. Keep automated scans within its rate limits and rules.

